  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5617,
      "text": "and prostrate to Him at night, and glorify Him at length by night[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5618,
      "text": "Indeed, these [pagans] love this fleeting life and pay no heed to a heavy Day ahead of them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5619,
      "text": "It is We Who created them and strengthened their build. If We will, We can replace them with others like them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5620,
      "text": "Indeed, this is a reminder; so let anyone who wills may take a way to his Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5621,
      "text": "But you cannot will unless Allah wills. Indeed, Allah is All-Knowing, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5622,
      "text": "He admits whom He wills into His mercy, but for the wrongdoers He has prepared a painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5623,
      "text": "By those [winds] sent forth in succession,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5624,
      "text": "those that blow violently,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5625,
      "text": "and scatter [rainclouds] far and wide,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5626,
      "text": "And by those [angels] who bring criterion[1];",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5627,
      "text": "and those who deliver revelation,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5628,
      "text": "leaving no excuse or giving warning –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5629,
      "text": "what you are promised will surely come to pass.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5630,
      "text": "So when the stars are effaced,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5631,
      "text": "and when the sky is split apart,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5632,
      "text": "and when the mountains are blown away,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5633,
      "text": "and when the messengers are summoned[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5634,
      "text": "until which Day has all this been postponed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5635,
      "text": "Until the Day of Judgment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5636,
      "text": "How do you know what the Day of Judgment is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5637,
      "text": "Woe on that Day to the deniers[3]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5638,
      "text": "Did We not destroy the earlier nations?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5639,
      "text": "Then We will do likewise to the later ones.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5640,
      "text": "This is how We deal with the wicked.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
